# Generated files are compared against freshly regenerated ones by
# scripts/test_offline.py. Without this, git checks them out with CRLF on Windows
# while the generators write LF, and the comparison fails on every clone but the
# one where the file was first written - which is the machine nobody checks.
*.csv   text eol=lf
*.gms   text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
